# Corporate Treasury Decision Memo: EUR 13.0M Royalty Receivable Hedge

**TO:** Chief Financial Officer (CFO)  
**FROM:** Lead Corporate Treasury Analyst  
**DATE:** October 23, 2026  
**SUBJECT:** Hedging Recommendation for EUR 13,000,000 IP Royalty Receivable (182-Day Tenor)  

---

## Executive Summary & Recommendation

We recommend executing a **100% Forward Contract Hedge** at the indicative 182-day rate of **1.1705 USD/EUR**, locking in guaranteed USD revenue of **$15,216,500 USD** for our EUR 13,000,000 chip-design royalty receivable.

This decision locks in a **$1,111,500 USD cash gain** over current spot value ($14,105,000 USD), requires **$0 upfront cash outlay**, and eliminates downside foreign exchange risk.

